      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/silver_city_north_carolina",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Silver City’s CDP borders Rockfish Creek, a tributary of the Cape Fear River, adding a natural waterway to its landscape.",
